### =====================================================
### Quick Create Bulk - POST /account/quickCreateBulk
### Crea hasta 20 usuarios con perfil compartido; en lote
### solo passwordMode auto o invite (no manual). Los errores
### por usuario regresan en data.errors dentro del 200.
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Múltiples usuarios con contraseña automática (auto) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/quickCreateBulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "users": [
    { "email": "janedoe.bulk@example.com", "completeName": "Jane Doe" },
    { "email": "jimdoe.bulk@example.com", "completeName": "Jim Doe" }
  ],
  "passwordMode": "auto",
  "requirePasswordChange": true,
  "operatorId": 307,
  "organizationId": 229,
  "divisionId": 192,
  "subdivisionId": 336,
  "accessLevelId": 20,
  "roleId": 1001,
  "utcZoneId": 178
}

### Test 2: Múltiples usuarios con invitación (invite) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/quickCreateBulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "users": [
    { "email": "invitado1.bulk@example.com", "completeName": "Invitado Uno" },
    { "email": "invitado2.bulk@example.com", "completeName": "Invitado Dos" }
  ],
  "passwordMode": "invite",
  "operatorId": 307,
  "organizationId": 229,
  "divisionId": 192,
  "subdivisionId": 336,
  "accessLevelId": 20,
  "roleId": 1001,
  "utcZoneId": 178
}

### Test 3: PasswordMode manual no permitido en lote — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/quickCreateBulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "users": [
    { "email": "manual.bulk@example.com", "completeName": "Manual Bulk" }
  ],
  "passwordMode": "manual",
  "operatorId": 307,
  "organizationId": 229,
  "divisionId": 192,
  "subdivisionId": 336,
  "accessLevelId": 20,
  "roleId": 1001,
  "utcZoneId": 178
}

### Test 4: Lista de usuarios vacía — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/quickCreateBulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
